  <item>
    <title>185. 【脑洞系列】极限二选一</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/699c32d8de29766da93ea80c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">699c32d8de29766da93ea80c</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 23 Feb 2026 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="79">01:19</a> 每次约会都被路人指着说“他劈腿了！” or 每次约会遇到老板</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="169">02:49</a> 要不要阴阳眼的特异功能</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="376">06:16</a> 阿飘是善意的还是恶意的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="459">07:39</a> 每晚做梦都梦到初恋 or 每次刷手机都能看到初恋的结婚照</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="670">11:10</a> 吵架 or 冷暴力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="970">16:10</a> 每次接电话都必须说一声“你好我是猪猪” or 每次挂电话的时候必须要唱：我要结婚了/老鼠爱大米/套马杆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1208">20:08</a> 假如你是男生，你要做直男 or 通讯录</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1661">27:41</a> 凌晨做咖啡但是很干净的室友 or 作息很正常但是吃熏鱼而且人很臭的室友</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1843">30:43</a> 每次必须要跳一支舞你才能出电梯门 or 每次打车司机都放你大学时候社团表演的录像</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1882">31:22</a> 约会带前任 or 面试带爸妈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2007">33:27</a> 生活选曼谷 or 东京</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2149">35:49</a> 领导讲话之后必须要鼓掌 or 领导发消息必须用语音回答</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2322">38:42</a> 一生只能穿crocs参加所有重要场合 or 所有照片里你永远在打喷嚏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2581">43:01</a> 前任做你的老板 or 现任做你的下属</span></p>]]></description>
